        {"zh": "蹄子踢出，敌人受伤。", "en": "Hooves strike and the foe is hurt."},
        {"zh": "用蹄子给它们一点教训！", "en": "Teach them a lesson with hooves!"},
        {"zh": "踢击，敌人倒退。", "en": "Kick and the enemy backs off."},
